  "body": "\n                <h2 rtrvr-ls=\"5~hs,6~hs,8~hs,9~hs\" rtrvr-ro=\"42\">The Modern Gamaka</h2><p rtrvr-ls=\"0~hs,5~hs,6~hs,8~hs,9~hs\" rtrvr-ro=\"42\">In underground music news and bustling festival stages across South India, a sonic revolution is underway. Young virtuosos trained in rigorous Tyagaraja kirtis are picking up live-string electric violins, digital synthesizers, and konnakol voice processors.</p>\n              ",
